(text "ADC1 only: GPIO0/1/3/4. GPIO5 is ADC2 and used as I2C SDA.\nGPIO2 is reserved with a pull-up. GPIO8 panic held HIGH for download.\nGPIO18/19 are native USB. UART0 GPIO20/21 serves the dust sensor." (at 18 112 0) (effects (font (size 1.35 1.35)) (justify left top)) (uuid "58811d49-949b-4c2b-a55a-ea21de79e099"))
